            json,
            new TypeReference<Map<String, Object>>() {}
        );

        result.entrySet().removeIf(entry -> entry.getValue() == null);
        return result;
    } catch (JsonProcessingException e) {
        throw new RuntimeException("Failed to convert object to map", e);
